MINI-V Android OS
===========

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/MINI-V, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the MINI-V trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/MINI-V_Android/android_manifest.git -b lineage-23.2 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```


About MINI-V
---------------
MINI-V is a customized Android based on [Lineage OS](https://lineageos.org/).

We targets to provide various AI features with On-device system. (Coming soon..!)


